          "label": "LOOKS LIKE",
          "color": "#E91E63",
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "A cat",
              "icon": "🐱",
              "cue": "cat"
            },
            {
              "text": "A sunset",
              "icon": "sun",
              "cue": "sunset"
            }
          ]
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "who": "DAD",
      "text": "So does it keep all those pictures inside, like a giant photo album?",
      "board": {
        "type": "big",
        "icon": "book",
        "text": "A giant photo album?",
        "cue": "album"
      }
    },
    {
      "who": "TEEN",
      "text": "Not like an album. Mostly it stores patterns, a sense of what things usually look like, in its learned dials. Not a folder of photos.",
      "board": {
        "type": "compare",
        "left": {
          "label": "MOSTLY STORES",
          "color": "#2ECC71",
          "items": [
            {
