          "items": [
            {
              "text": "A photo folder",
              "icon": "x",
              "cue": "folder"
            }
          ]
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "who": "TEEN",
      "text": "Though researchers have found it can sometimes copy bits of its training pictures too closely. That's one reason people debate it.",
      "board": {
        "type": "big",
